Each week, we will dive deeper into the world of The Office with exclusive interviews, behind-the-scenes details, and lots of BFF stories.
每周，我们都会通过独家采访、幕后花絮和大量闺蜜故事，带你深入探索《办公室》的世界。

7
00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:23.130
We're the Office Lady 6.0.
我们是《办公室女士 6.0》。

8
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:30.210
The Finer Things Club is the most exclusive club in this office.
“高雅事物俱乐部”是办公室里最高级的俱乐部。

9
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.090
Naturally, it's where I need to be.
理所当然，那才是我该待的地方。

10
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:36.550
The party planning committee is my backup, and Kevin's band is my safety.
派对策划委员会是我的备选，凯文的乐队是我的安全保障。

11
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:38.950
Hello, everyone.
大家好。

12
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:39.710
Hi.
嗨。

13
00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:46.630
We are so excited because today on Office Lady 6.0, it's a meeting of the Finer Things Club.
我们非常兴奋，因为今天在《办公室女士 6.0》中，我们将举行一场“高雅事物俱乐部”的聚会。

14
00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:51.190
Okay, so I loved doing the Finer Things Club storyline so much.
好的，我非常喜欢拍摄“高雅事物俱乐部”的那段剧情。

15
00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.070
It's one of my favorite office memories.
那是我在《办公室》中最美好的回忆之一。

16
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.470
I'm so excited to talk about it today.
我非常期待今天能聊聊它。

17
00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.290
I wanted to be in the Finer Things Club.
我一直想加入“高雅事物俱乐部”。

18
00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.250
So I'm very excited.
所以我非常兴奋。

19
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.950
Today, I get to be an honorary member.
今天，我有幸成为一名荣誉会员。

20
00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:03.710
Yes, that's right.
没错，就是这样。

21
00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:08.910
Because today, we are going to talk a little bit about Dunder Mifflin's Finer Things Club,
因为今天，我们要聊聊邓德·米夫林公司的“高雅事物俱乐部”，

22
00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:13.430
