这就像《黑客帝国》一样，东西就在那儿，而你会想，什么？

139
00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:11.650
That's been there the whole time?
它一直都在那儿吗？

140
00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:12.930
Yeah, I had no idea.
是的，我完全不知道。

141
00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.110
I just lead everything back to you.
我只是把一切都引向你。

142
00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:15.690
All right.
好吧。

143
00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:16.890
I'm opening it.
我要拆开了。

144
00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:17.590
All right.
好的。

145
00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.470
Now, Cassie, I know you read a lot.
凯西，我知道你读了很多书。

146
00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:23.530
It was very hard for me to think of a book that maybe you hadn't read, so you may have
