a website to share with everyone.
一个网站想和大家分享。

967
00:42:58.350 --> 00:43:03.370
It's a blog called A Lady in London, and she goes over all the best places to have afternoon
那是一个叫“伦敦淑女”的博客，她介绍了伦敦所有最棒的下午茶

968
00:43:03.370 --> 00:43:04.050
tea in London.
地点。

