它太好吃了。

1008
00:44:32.110 --> 00:44:33.890
Even though we said we wouldn't eat any more on mic.
尽管我们说好不在麦克风前再吃东西了。

1009
00:44:34.410 --> 00:44:36.870
It was so delicious and so fun.
它真的又好吃又有趣。

1010
00:44:36.970 --> 00:44:39.610
And we sat there with our hats and our fascinators.
我们戴着帽子和礼帽坐在那儿。

1011
00:44:40.010 --> 00:44:41.710
You and Cassie were the fascinators.
你和凯西戴的是礼帽。

