Me and Sam wore the hats.
我和萨姆戴的是帽子。

1013
00:44:43.170 --> 00:44:44.710
We had a delicious tea.
我们喝了一顿美味的下午茶。

1014
00:44:44.710 --> 00:44:46.430
And what do we think, you guys?
大家觉得怎么样？

1015
00:44:46.570 --> 00:44:54.450
Did you like Queen Elizabeth II's version of the cucumber sandwich or the other version that was from the tea house?
你们是更喜欢伊丽莎白二世女王版的黄瓜三明治，还是茶馆里的那个版本？

1016
00:44:54.610 --> 00:44:55.410
I like the one you brought.
