00:44:58.510 --> 00:45:05.650
And I was asking you what the difference was because the ones we got from the tea house were like a cream cheese and cucumber sandwich, which I've had many times.
我当时问你区别在哪，因为我们在茶馆吃到的是奶油奶酪黄瓜三明治，我吃过很多次了。

