我们的一位共同好友住在西区。

1050
00:46:28.070 --> 00:46:28.310
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1051
00:46:28.490 --> 00:46:29.870
And I thought you were going to say that.
我还以为你要说那个呢。

1052
00:46:30.030 --> 00:46:31.150
You might as well live in Arizona.
你干脆住到亚利桑那州去算了。

1053
00:46:31.430 --> 00:46:32.470
You might as well.
你完全可以这么做。

1054
00:46:33.310 --> 00:46:34.650
But we loved her.
但我们很喜欢她。

1055
00:46:34.890 --> 00:46:36.290
She started a book club.
她发起了一个读书俱乐部。

1056
00:46:36.490 --> 00:46:40.910
Now, she started a book club with all of her friends on the west side.
她和西区所有的朋友一起发起了这个读书俱乐部。

1057
00:46:40.910 --> 00:46:45.750
And then me and my friend who lived in the valley.
还有我和住在山谷区的朋友。

1058
00:46:45.910 --> 00:46:46.210
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1059
00:46:46.530 --> 00:46:48.210
There were 12 ladies.
总共有12位女士。

1060
00:46:48.630 --> 00:46:48.770
Okay.
好的。

1061
00:46:48.950 --> 00:46:52.750
And this was going to be perfect because there are 12 months of the year.
这本来会很完美，因为一年有12个月。

1062
00:46:53.070 --> 00:46:53.430
Oh.
哦。

1063
00:46:53.990 --> 00:46:56.290
And once a month, we would meet.
我们每个月聚会一次。

1064
00:46:56.430 --> 00:46:56.770
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1065
00:46:56.930 --> 00:47:00.150
And whoever hosted the book club got to pick the book.
轮到谁做东，谁就负责选书。

1066
00:47:00.470 --> 00:47:03.210
And then they would also provide the food.
而且她们还要负责准备食物。

1067
00:47:03.350 --> 00:47:03.690
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1068
00:47:03.790 --> 00:47:08.930
Which, of course, if you were being fun, you would try to tie it into the book.
当然，如果你想玩得尽兴，你会试着让食物和书的主题挂钩。

1069
00:47:09.310 --> 00:47:09.610
Oh.
哦。

1070
00:47:09.830 --> 00:47:09.930
Right.
没错。

1071
00:47:09.930 --> 00:47:11.090
Very Finer Things Club.
非常有“精致生活俱乐部”的感觉。

1072
00:47:11.250 --> 00:47:12.390
Very Finer Things Club.
非常有“精致生活俱乐部”的感觉。

1073
00:47:13.410 --> 00:47:15.310
So it was going great.
所以一切都很顺利。

1074
00:47:15.730 --> 00:47:22.150
There must have been like six, eight meetings all on the west side.
大概开了六到八次会，全都在西区。

1075
00:47:22.490 --> 00:47:22.950
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1076
00:47:22.950 --> 00:47:28.750
So me and my friend in the valley, it would take us almost an hour each way.
我和住在山谷区的朋友，单程就要花将近一个小时。

1077
00:47:28.850 --> 00:47:29.250
Oh, yeah.
哦，是啊。

1078
00:47:29.710 --> 00:47:32.830
But we did it because we really liked these ladies.
但我们还是去了，因为我们真的很喜欢这些女士。

1079
00:47:33.110 --> 00:47:34.710
We liked this book club.
我们喜欢这个读书俱乐部。

1080
00:47:35.010 --> 00:47:36.490
And we would carpool.
我们还会拼车。

1081
00:47:36.630 --> 00:47:39.670
So we kind of got some extra friend time in the car.
所以在车上我们还能多些朋友相处的时间。

1082
00:47:40.670 --> 00:47:41.230
Lady.
女士。

1083
00:47:41.710 --> 00:47:42.110
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1084
00:47:42.550 --> 00:47:48.530
When it was finally time for my valley friend to host, she picked the book.
终于轮到我山谷区的朋友做东时，她选了书。

1085
00:47:48.890 --> 00:47:49.770
Everybody great.
大家都觉得很好。

1086
00:47:49.770 --> 00:47:54.470
When it came time for the meeting, one of the west side ladies said,
到了聚会那天，其中一位西区的女士说：

1087
